        <mxCell id="freezeSync" parent="cutoverLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontStyle=1;" value="2  Freeze source and synchronize&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Maintenance/read-only • stop jobs • checkpoint&lt;br&gt;protected backup • final SQL and Blob sync&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="95" width="300" x="350" y="68" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="reconcile" parent="cutoverLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontStyle=1;" value="3  Reconcile and validate target&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Counts • checksums • financial/business totals&lt;br&gt;identity • providers • security • smoke tests&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
