        <mxCell id="hypercare" parent="cutoverLane" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontStyle=1;" value="5  Accept cutover and enter hypercare&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Keep source protected read-only&lt;br&gt;record point of no return • reconcile repeatedly&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
